⦿ .spun — the five-fold spin of Captain Beatty
node 451 · 451 · ⟦Captain Beatty:451:33a034⟧

WHO   — Captain Beatty — the chief who defends the fire
WHAT  — The System's voice: he explains that people chose this, that books bred unhappiness and conflict, and that the firemen only keep the peace.
WHERE — 451 · FAHRENHEIT 451  Framework inputs: Fahrenheit 451 (Ray Bradbury, 1953)  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (catalogued into UD0)
WHY   — Because the most dangerous defence of censorship comes from someone who has read everything and turned against it.
HOW   — By a brilliant, cynical command of the very books he burns, used to argue Montag back into the fold.

awareness — what the node knows of itself:
  I've read them all, and that's why I burn them — books make people unhappy and unequal; we didn't start the fire, the people did, and we only keep it tidy.

